# Download scratch dirs. video.py creates .vimeo-dl-<url_hash>/ next to the
# output file and rmtree's it on success -- one left behind means that
# download never finished muxing. They hold segment .tmp files plus the
# assembled video.mp4/audio.mp4, so they get very large (tens of GB each).
.vimeo-dl-*/

# Downloaded media
*.mp4

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
build/
dist/
*.spec
